{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 24, :comments ["<b>מזי רעב</b> The mention of five things: מזי רעב, ולחומי רשף, וקטב מרירי, ושן בהמות, עם חמת זוחלי עפר — corresponding to the five [violations] they committed against HaShem: five [cases of] adultery in Hosea, five abominations that Ezekiel saw, and corresponding to the five [verses of] those who offer incense: לבעל, לשמש, ולירח, ולמזלות, ולכל צבא השמים."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 32, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:11:17.171407487Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}